  "label": "Bulldog as Angry or Defiant Stereotype",
  "description": "The bulldog's intense, slightly aggressive facial expression is culturally associated with anger, defiance, or stubbornness. This stereotype is used in memes to visually amplify the emotional tone of the text, making the declaration appear more forceful and confrontational. The image leverages this real-world association to convey rage and rejection.",
